{"id":"498a7886c9e7fc97","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-cohen-condition.md","title":"ZFC Cohen Condition","display":"df-zfc-cohen-condition — ZFC Cohen Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cohen-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cohen-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-cohen-condition — ZFC Cohen Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cohen-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cohen-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cohen-condition — ZFC Cohen Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md\">../batch14/58-df-cohen.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(p,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md\">../batch14/58-df-cohen.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land p\\in P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land p\\in P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order parameter is part of the canonical upstream signature; for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=1\">\\(\\kappa=1\\)</span>, conditions are finite partial functions from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> ordered by reverse inclusion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cohen}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CohenCondition}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land p\\in P\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false}],"bytes":879,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1629","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-cohen-condition.md|58-df-zfc-cohen-condition]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","aa69e82627a80f1e"]}